.TH LYRICS-TERM 1 "2026" "2.0.0-alpha" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lyrics-term \- synced song lyrics for MPRIS music players
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lyrics-term
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B lyrics-term
\fB\-\-list\-players\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lyrics-term
follows the music player that is currently playing over MPRIS, fetches synced
lyrics from lrclib.net and shows the current line in the terminal. The line is
drawn with a built-in block font, or as a true-font image when run in kitty.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Colors and layout
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-color " " \fICOLOR\fR
Name (cyan, green, red, yellow, blue, magenta, white) or HEX value (#00ffcc).
.TP
.BI \-\-from\-kitty " COLOR"
Color from the kitty palette (color0 to color15, foreground) or HEX.
.TP
.BI \-\-align " left|center"
Horizontal alignment. Default: center.
.TP
.BI \-\-vpos " N"
Vertical position from 0 (top) to 100 (bottom). Default: 50.
.TP
.B \-\-rainbow
Give every line its own hue.
.TP
.B \-\-dim\-paused
Dim the text while the player is paused.
.TP
.B \-\-fade
Fade each new line in over four frames (kitty only).
.SS Player
.TP
.BI \-\-player " NAME"
Follow only the player whose name contains NAME (spotify, mpv, audacious).
.TP
.B \-\-list\-players
List MPRIS players and exit.
.SS What to show
.TP
.B \-\-no\-header
Hide the header.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-artist
Show only the title in the header.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-source
Hide the player name in the header.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-missing
Hide the "missing in font" hint (block renderer).
.TP
.B \-\-clean
Same as \fB\-\-no\-artist \-\-no\-source \-\-no\-missing\fR.
.TP
.B \-\-prev
Show the previous line above, dimmed.
.TP
.B \-\-next
Show the next line below, dimmed.
.TP
.BI \-\-mode " line|word"
Show whole lines, or one word at a time.
.SS Files
.TP
.BI \-\-export " PATH"
Write the current line to PATH. The file is replaced atomically.
.TP
.BI \-\-save\-lrc " DIR"
Save every .lrc file that was found into DIR.
.SS Rendering
.TP
.BI \-\-renderer " block|kitty"
Block font in any terminal, or an image in kitty.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-bold
No bold weight (block renderer).
.TP
.BI \-\-style " bold|mono|soft"
Font style for the kitty renderer.
.TP
.BI \-\-font " PATH"
Custom TrueType font for the kitty renderer.
.TP
.BI \-\-font\-size " N"
Font size in pixels for the kitty renderer. Default: 56.
.TP
.BI \-\-spacing " N"
Letter spacing in pixels for the kitty renderer.
.TP
.B \-\-glow \fR/\fB \-\-no\-glow
Enable or disable the glow effect (kitty renderer).
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B + / \-
Shift the sync by 0.1 s.
.TP
.B 0
Reset the sync shift.
.TP
.B v
Switch to the next synced version of the current track, if lrclib has one.
.TP
.B q
Quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cache/lyrics-term/
Cache of lyrics lookups. A failed network request is not cached; a track without
synced lyrics is cached as empty.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XDG_CACHE_HOME
Used instead of ~/.cache when set.
.SH NOTES
Synchronization depends on the player reporting its Position over MPRIS.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kitty (1),
.BR mpris-proxy (1)
